abstract: "A critical integrative review distinguishing sensory rhetoric and human synaesthesia from functional AI, connecting informative variation with identifiability, and examining bounded evolutionary analogies. Exact algebraic illustrations and an unperformed physical validation agenda accompany the synthesis."
